# Host build artefacts must never be copied into the image.
#
# `.venv` is a virtualenv built for the host platform - useless inside the
# container and megabytes of it. `var/` holds the CVM archive cache, ~13 MB
# per fiscal year, which is derived data the container re-downloads on
# demand and must never be baked into a layer.
.venv
venv
var/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Secrets never belong in an image layer.
.env
.env.*

*.log
